schema: public-use-boundary
object:
  title: Boundary — organizational security/treasury recommendations carry real financial risk
  tier: public-with-caveat
  consent_note: >-
    This article gives concrete operational security recommendations for
    organizations holding real cryptocurrency treasuries (multi-sig
    thresholds, hot/cold wallet splits, access-control tiers, emergency
    response procedures). If treated as complete or authoritative guidance
    without adaptation to a specific organization's context, gaps could
    directly expose real funds. Per the ingest skill's high-risk triggers
    ("funding... recommendations"), flag for security-domain-expert review
    before promotion to public "reviewed" guidance.
  review_type: security-domain-expert-review-before-promotion
  notes: >-
    Applies to the sibling encyclopedia-entry, concept-lineage, claim-
    evidence, and resource candidates from this same work order.
  high_risk: true
